{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/991804-lay-open-the-mind","id":991804,"title":"Lay open the mind","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-23T04:35:18-07:00","id":991804,"title":"Lay open the mind","content":"Hi,<br /> <br /> after had established the link with the subject mind should her stay under the vampire sight in order to continue to read the mind? What is the range of the power? What about if the subject goes in another room? Behind a wall/column in the same room?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-23T06:19:23-07:00","id":991817,"title":"","content":"There's no real range on any of the Auspex powers named. Given that its an expansion of Kindred Senses, however, its generally accepted that the target has to be in sensory range (without using cameras or binoculars or similar) in some way. Sight, sound, smell, something. <br /> <br /> As for going into another room? That depends on your ST and how they feel. There's no official answer on that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"